"Playback Features: FAQ – tonies® Support (https://support.tonies.com/hc/en-150/articles/37307520777874-Playback-Features-FAQ)\nciteturn775search0 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: last week;   * ⏸️ Pause and Play: Halt the action for a quick snack break and jump right back in when you're ready. ... Do these features work with Tonieplay games, or just Tonies?\n\n# Playback Features: FAQ\n\nWe're delighted to be bringing you one of our most requested features.\n\nThat's right, it is now possible to utilise the following Playback Features in app.\n\n  * 👀 Live Playback Status: See exactly which Tonie is on the box and view the chapter currently playing, right from your scree\n  * ⏸️ Pause and Play: Halt the action for a quick snack break and jump right back in when you're ready.\n  * ⏮️ Restart and Skip: Instantly rewind to a favorite song or skip ahead to the next chapter.\n\nAre these features compatible with my Toniebox 1?\n\nThat's a great question!\n\nWe know some Toniebox 1 families have been hoping for playback controls. Unfortunately, these features rely on hardware and software capabilities that are unique to Toniebox 2, so aren't compatible with Toniebox 1.\n\nWe understand this might be disappointing, and we really appreciate you being part of the tonies® family - Toniebox 1 will keep doing what it does best!\n\nDo these features work when we are on the road/in offline mode?\n\nThe Playback Control features require an active internet connection to work and will not work in offline mode.\n\nIf you would like to use these features while on the road, we recommend connecting your Toniebox to your mobile device's personal hotspot.\n\nDo these features work with Tonieplay games, or just Tonies?\n\nOur Playback Control features will only be functional with all of our Tonies.\n\nFor Tonieplay games, this feature is limited to volume controls.--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nCan I restart a Tonieplay game? – tonies® Support (https://support.tonies.com/hc/en-150/articles/29036401221522-Can-I-restart-a-Tonieplay-game)\nciteturn775search1 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: 2 weeks ago; Simply lift the Tonieplay Disc off your Toniebox 2, count to five (a little dramatic pause never hurt anyone ✨), and pop it back on.\n\n# Can I restart a Tonieplay game?\n\nNeed to go back a bit in your game? \n\nEasy! Simply lift the Tonieplay Disc off your Toniebox 2, count to five (a little dramatic pause never hurt anyone ✨), and pop it back on. Your game will restart from the top, or depending on the Tonieplay game, will pick up at your most recent checkpoint, if you've reached one. Think of it as closing a book and opening it again to your bookmarked page... \n\nA few things to know:\n\n  * A full reset is not possible, until the game is completed so keep on playing. \n  * No checkpoint yet? The game will begin from the very start of your adventure.\n  * Reached a checkpoint? Taking the disc off and back on will restart the game to that checkpoint. \n  * Mid-adventure and want a quick breather? Removing the disc is a safe way to pause and step away; just pop it back on when you're ready to continue.--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nWiedergabefunktionen: FAQ – tonies® Support (https://support.tonies.com/hc/de/articles/37307520777874-Wiedergabefunktionen-FAQ)\nciteturn775search2 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: last week;   * ⏯️ Pause und Wiedergabe: Halte das Hörabenteuer für eine kurze Snackpause an und springe direkt wieder rein, sobald du bereit bist. ... Kann ich diese Funktionen auch bei Tonieplay-Spielen nutzen oder nur bei Tonies?\n\n# Wiedergabefunktionen: FAQ\n\nWir freuen uns riesig, dir eine unserer meistgewünschten Funktionen vorzustellen!\nRichtig gehört: Ab sofort kannst du die folgenden Wiedergabefunktionen direkt in der App nutzen.\n\n  * 👀 Live-Wiedergabestatus: Sieh genau, welche Toniefigur auf der Toniebox steht, und verfolge das aktuelle Kapitel direkt auf deinem Bildschirm.\n  * ⏯️ Pause und Wiedergabe: Halte das Hörabenteuer für eine kurze Snackpause an und springe direkt wieder rein, sobald du bereit bist.\n  * ⏮️ Neustart und Überspringen: Spule blitzschnell zu deinem Lieblingslied zurück oder springe direkt zum nächsten Kapitel vor.\n\nSind diese Funktionen mit meiner Toniebox 1 kompatibel?\n\nDas ist eine super Frage! \nWir wissen, dass sich viele Toniebox 1-Familien Wiedergabe-Steuerungen gewünscht haben. Leider basieren diese neuen Funktionen auf Hardware- und Software-Voraussetzungen, die es nur bei der Toniebox 2 gibt. Deshalb sind sie mit der Toniebox 1 nicht kompatibel.\n\nWir verstehen, dass das enttäuschend sein kann, und schätzen es sehr, dass ihr Teil der tonies®-Familie seid – die Toniebox 1 wird auch weiterhin genau das tun, was sie am besten kann!\n\nKann ich diese Funktionen auch unterwegs oder im Offline-Modus nutzen?\n\nDie Wiedergabe-Steuerung erfordert eine aktive Internetverbindung und funktioniert daher nicht im Offline-Modus.\n\nWenn du diese Funktionen aber trotzdem unterwegs nutzen möchtest, empfehlen wir dir, deine Toniebox einfach mit dem persönlichen Hotspot deines Mobilgeräts zu verbinden.\n\nKann ich diese Funktionen auch bei Tonieplay-Spielen nutzen oder nur bei Tonies?\n\nDie Funktionen zur Wiedergabe-Steuerung funktionieren aktuell nur mit unseren Tonies. \nBei Tonieplay-Spielen ist diese Funktion auf die Lautstärkeregelung beschränkt.--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nKann ich ein Tonieplay-Spiel neu starten? – tonies® Support (https://support.tonies.com/hc/de/articles/29036401221522-Kann-ich-ein-Tonieplay-Spiel-neu-starten)\nciteturn775search3 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: 2 weeks ago; Hebe einfach die Tonieplay-Disc von deiner Toniebox 2 ab, zähle bis fünf (eine kleine Verschnaufpause hat noch niemandem geschadet ✨) und setze sie wieder auf.\n\n# Kann ich ein Tonieplay-Spiel neu starten?\n\nMöchtest du in deinem Spiel etwas zurückgehen?\n\nGanz einfach! Hebe einfach die Tonieplay-Disc von deiner Toniebox 2 ab, zähle bis fünf (eine kleine Verschnaufpause hat noch niemandem geschadet ✨) und setze sie wieder auf. Dein Spiel startet dann von vorne oder, je nach Tonieplay-Spiel, an deinem letzten erreichten Kontrollpunkt, falls du einen erreicht hast. Man kann es sich vorstellen wie ein Buch, das man schließt und wieder an der markierten Seite öffnet...\n\nEin paar Dinge, die du wissen solltest:\n\n  * Ein vollständiger Reset ist nicht möglich, bis das Spiel abgeschlossen ist, also spielt einfach weiter bis ihr an das Ende eures Abenteuers gelangt seid.\n  * Noch keinen Kontrollpunkt erreicht? Das Spiel beginnt dann ganz am Anfang deines Abenteuers.\n  * Kontrollpunkt erreicht? Das Abnehmen und Wiederaufsetzen der Disc startet das Spiel an diesem Kontrollpunkt neu.\n  * Möchtest du mitten im Abenteuer eine kurze Pause machen? Das Entfernen der Tonieplay-Disc ist eine sichere Möglichkeit, das Spiel zu pausieren und eine Pause einzulegen. Setze sie einfach wieder auf, wenn du bereit bist, weiterzumachen.--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nTonieplay – tonies® Support (https://support.tonies.com/hc/en-gb/sections/29036400009490-Tonieplay)\nciteturn775search4 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: last week; Simply lift the Tonieplay Disc off your Toniebox 2, count to five (a little dramatic pause never hurt anyone ✨), and pop it back on.\n\n# Tonieplay\n\n### Popular Articles\n\nTonieplay\n\nBrowse Topic\n\nQuick Search\n\n[Input: Search for articles, guides, and help...]\n\n## Articles\n\n14 articles\n\n### What is Tonieplay?\n\nLet the listening journey continue! Designed especially for Toniebox 2, Tonieplay turns the Toniebox into a safe and screen-free gaming experience. You’ll need a Tonieplay controller to play any of our amazing Tonieplay games – both are sold separately.\n\n### Tonieplay - Troubleshooting Tips\n\nLet's take a look at some of the most common Tonieplay troubleshooting tips, to get your adventure off to a great start! Tonieplay game taking too long to download When you place a Tonieplay game on your Toniebox 2 for the very first time, it needs to download the game before the fun can begin. This...\n\n### Tonieplay game card not recognised\n\nWe’re sorry to hear you’re having trouble with your Tonieplay game cards! Don’t worry - we’ll help you get back on track. Sometimes a simple restart solves the issue: Make sure your Toniebox 2 is on and unplugged. Squeeze both ears until the Toniebox enters the sleep light with timer setting. Keep s...\n\n### How long does the Toniebox 2 remember your auto-saved status when you remove the disc, take a break or play something else?\n\nIf you remove your Tonieplay disc for a break or to play another Tonie product, the progress will stop. This means that the game is not \"paused\" anymore, but you will load it up from scratch again. However, each game acts a little differently. For example the quiz games will not continue a running r...\n\n### Can you ever choose the chapter?\n\nThat highly depends on the games, but in most cases: no. The only game that lets you choose which story to play is Winnie The Pooh.\n\n### Can I restart a Tonieplay game?\n\nNeed to go back a bit in your game? Easy! Simply lift the Tonieplay Disc off your Toniebox 2, count to five (a little dramatic pause never hurt anyone ✨), and pop it back on. Your game will restart from the top, or depending on the Tonieplay game, will pick up at your most recent checkpoint, if you'...\n\n### What do I need in order to play a Tonieplay game?\n\nTo play a Tonieplay Game you’ll need a Toniebox 2 and a Tonieplay Controller. If it’s the first time the game is being played you’ll also need a WiFi connection, but after this it will work offline too.\n\n### What aged children is Tonieplay suitable for?\n\nThere are Tonieplay games for everyone from 3 years and up, with even more coming soon...\n\n### Is Tonieplay compatible with Toniebox 1?\n\nNo, due to the technological advancements of Tonieplay, it’s only compatible with our newest model, the Toniebox 2.\n\n### Are Tonieplay games multiplayer?\n\nGreat question! Yes! Although our Tonieplay Games are designed for solo play, they can all also be enjoyed together with friends or family.\n\n### How much help will my child need with playing a Tonieplay game?\n\nJust like with classic board games, we recommend parents join in for the first few rounds to help kids get started. Tonieplay Games are designed to be easy to follow, but we’ve also included a written manual in every box for those who prefer to read up first. Younger players may need a little suppor...\n\n### Can I skip past the intro to the Tonieplay game?\n\nYes! Most games include a skip feature so you can move forward or back through the story. Intros are usually skippable, but some moments – like answering a quiz question or making a choice in an interactive story – can’t be replayed right away.\n\n### How do Tonieplay games appear in the app?\n\nJust like with all our other Tonies, once you’ve put a Tonieplay Game on the Toniebox 2 you’ll be able to see it in the ‘Mine’ section of the app.\n\n### What new Tonieplay specific data will we capture?\n\nWhen you use the new function Tonieplay, usage and operation information about the in-game interaction with the Toniebox will be collected. We process the data (e.g. frequency of use of individual games, errors that resulted in termination of use) for the same purpose as we process all other Interac...--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nSleep Light with Timer & Sunrise Alarm guide – tonies® Support (https://support.tonies.com/hc/en-gb/articles/29255589102866-Sleep-Light-with-Timer-Sunrise-Alarm-guide)\nciteturn775search5 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: last week; Tap the button “Sleep Timer with Light” (small stopwatch icon) and scroll down to “Set time & Sunrise Alarm”. ... Set the time and activate “Sunrise Alarm”.\n\n# Sleep Light with Timer & Sunrise Alarm guide\n\nThe Sleep Light with Timer helps little ones drift off with a soft, adjustable glow and a customisable timer. The Sunrise Alarm wakes them up with energising light and sound, staying gently lit until the alarm sounds. \n\nPlease note: As the Sunrise Alarm requires connection to the charger it is only available in 3+ mode.\nLet's take a look at some of the top troubleshooting tips for both features.\n\nHow to turn on the sleep timer?\n\nVia the tonies® app:\n\n  1. Locate your Toniebox 2 under \"Mine\" in the tonies® app\n  2. With your Toniebox 2 online, go to “Sleep Timer with Light” (small stopwatch icon).\n  3. Select how long the Toniebox 2 continues playing before it switches off (5 minutes - 1 hour).\n  4. Once chosen, the button shows the remaining time and the light ring switches to an orange light.\n  5. You can restart the timer, stop it, or switch off the Toniebox 2 immediately.\n\nVia the ears:\n\n  1. Squeeze both ears for 5 seconds, the light ring will slowly turn orange. Default timer out of the box is 30 mins, editable via app. The Toniebox 2 will remember your last sleep timer setting configuration and use this next time you squeeze both ears for 5 seconds.\n  2. To turn off, squeeze both ears for 5 seconds until the orange light disappears, you hear a ding, and the light ring is green again.\n\nYou can set this every night before bed as part of your routine via the app with your sleepy little one.\n\nHow do I turn on the Sunrise Alarm?\n\n  1. Locate your Toniebox 2 under \"Mine\" in the tonies® app\n  2. With your Toniebox 2 online, go to “Sleep Timer with Light” (small stopwatch icon).\n  3. Tap the button “Sleep Timer with Light” (small stopwatch icon) and scroll down to “Set time & Sunrise Alarm”.\n  4. Set the time and activate “Sunrise Alarm”. Adjust the volume, add a tone (tap on “Tone” to open the selection), and include a sunrise light if you want to.\n\nImportant note: \n\n  * To make sure the Sunrise Alarm works, don’t leave a Tonie playing on top of the Toniebox 2 as then the alarm will not sound.\n  * To make sure that the alarm works as intended, the Toniebox 2 must have enough charge to last until the alarm sounds. If the battery runs out, the Sunrise Alarm won’t start.\n\nHow do I adjust the Bedtime & Sleep Light preferences? (Volume and Light)\n\nVolume and brightness of the orange Sleep Light are adjustable during bedtime mode. These settings become active as soon as the Sleep Timer is running or you have activated the Sunrise Alarm\n\n  1. Tap on “Settings” (top right-hand corner) and scroll to “Bedtime & Sleep Light”.\n  2. Tap on “Preferences” and change the settings as desired.\n\nHow long will the Sleep Light with Timer stay on for?\n\nThe Sleep Light will stay on through out the night or until the timer ends. If you do not want this, you can dim or disable the light in the tonies® app. --------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nCommandes de lecture – tonies® Assistance (https://support.tonies.com/hc/fr-fr/articles/37307520777874-Commandes-de-lecture)\nciteturn775search6 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: last week;   * ⏸️ Pause et lecture : mettez l'action en pause, puis reprenez là où vous en étiez dès que vous êtes prêt. ... Ces fonctionnalités fonctionnent-elles avec les jeux Tonieplay, ou seulement avec les Tonies ?\n\n# Commandes de lecture\n\nNous sommes ravis de vous proposer l'une des fonctionnalités les plus demandées.\n\nEn effet, il est désormais possible d'utiliser les fonctionnalités suivantes dans l'application :\n\n  * 👀 Lecture en direct : découvrez exactement quel Tonie se trouve sur la Toniebox et visualisez le chapitre en cours de lecture directement sur l’application.\n  * ⏸️ Pause et lecture : mettez l'action en pause, puis reprenez là où vous en étiez dès que vous êtes prêt.\n  * ⏮️ Redémarrer et passer : revenez instantanément à l'une de vos chansons préférées ou passez directement au chapitre suivant.\n\nCes fonctionnalités seront-elles compatibles avec ma Toniebox 1 ?\n\nC'est une excellente question !\n\nNous savons que certaines familles possédant la Toniebox 1 espéraient voir arriver les commandes de lecture.\n\nMalheureusement, ces fonctionnalités reposent sur des capacités matérielles et logicielles uniques à la Toniebox 2, elles ne sont donc pas compatibles avec la Toniebox 1.\n\nNous comprenons que cela puisse être décevant, et nous vous remercions chaleureusement de faire partie de la famille tonies® – la Toniebox 1 continuera de faire ce qu'elle fait de mieux ! \n\nCes fonctionnalités fonctionnent-elles lorsque nous sommes en déplacement ou en mode hors ligne ?\n\nLes fonctionnalités de commande de lecture nécessitent une connexion Internet active pour fonctionner.\n\nSi vous souhaitez utiliser ces fonctionnalités lorsque vous êtes en déplacement, nous vous recommandons de connecter votre Toniebox au point d'accès mobile (partage de connexion) de votre smartphone ou tablette.\n\nCes fonctionnalités fonctionnent-elles avec les jeux Tonieplay, ou seulement avec les Tonies ?\n\nNos fonctionnalités de commande de lecture seront pleinement fonctionnelles avec l'ensemble de nos Tonies. Pour ce qui est des jeux Tonieplay, cette fonctionnalité se limite aux commandes de volume.--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nPuis-je redémarrer un jeu Tonieplay ? – tonies® Assistance (https://support.tonies.com/hc/fr-fr/articles/29036401221522-Puis-je-red%C3%A9marrer-un-jeu-Tonieplay)\nciteturn775search7 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: 2 weeks ago; Il suffit de retirer le disque Tonieplay de votre Toniebox 2, de compter jusqu’à cinq (une petite pause très rapide ✨), puis de le remettre en place.\n\n# Puis-je redémarrer un jeu Tonieplay ?\n\nVous voulez revenir un peu en arrière dans votre jeu ? \n\nC’est facile ! Il suffit de retirer le disque Tonieplay de votre Toniebox 2, de compter jusqu’à cinq (une petite pause très rapide ✨), puis de le remettre en place. \nVotre jeu redémarrera depuis le début ou, selon le jeu Tonieplay, reprendra à votre dernier point de contrôle, si vous en avez atteint un. \nC'est un peu comme fermer un livre et l’ouvrir à nouveau à la page marquée 😊.\n\nQuelques points à savoir :\n\n  * Une réinitialisation complète n’est pas possible, tant que le jeu n’est pas terminé, il faut continuer à jouer et à terminer l'aventure ! \n  * Pas encore de point de contrôle ? Le jeu commencera depuis le tout début de votre aventure.\n  * Point de contrôle atteint ? Retirer et remettre le disque redémarrera le jeu à ce point de contrôle. \n  * En plein milieu de l’aventure et besoin d’une pause rapide ? Retirer le disque est un moyen sûr de mettre le jeu en pause et de vous éloigner ; il suffit de le remettre en place quand vous êtes prêt à continuer.--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nCombien de temps la Toniebox 2 sauvegarde-t-elle automatiquement votre progression lorsque vous retirez le disque, faites une pause ou écoutez un autre contenu ? – tonies® Assistance (https://support.tonies.com/hc/fr-fr/articles/29036389045778-Combien-de-temps-la-Toniebox-2-sauvegarde-t-elle-automatiquement-votre-progression-lorsque-vous-retirez-le-disque-faites-une-pause-ou-%C3%A9coutez-un-autre-contenu)\nciteturn775search8 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: 2 weeks ago; Si vous retirez votre disque Tonieplay pour faire une pause ou pour écouter un autre Tonie, la progression du jeu s’arrêtera.\n\n# Combien de temps la Toniebox 2 sauvegarde-t-elle automatiquement votre progression lorsque vous retirez le disque, faites une pause ou écoutez un autre contenu ?\n\nSi vous retirez votre disque Tonieplay pour faire une pause ou pour écouter un autre Tonie, la progression du jeu s’arrêtera. Cela signifie que le jeu ne sera pas “en pause” et il redémarrera depuis le début.\nCependant, chaque type de jeu fonctionne un peu différemment. Par exemple, les quiz reviendront en arrière d'environ 5 questions. Une histoire interactive, elle, pourra être reprise à la dernière position. Un jeu Découverte, quant à lui, commencera une nouvelle partie.\n\nVeuillez noter que vous aurez également besoin d'une connexion Wi-Fi et attendre le téléchargement du jeu pour débuter une partie à nouveau. --------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nMeet the Toniebox 2: Features FAQ – tonies® Support (https://support.tonies.com/hc/en-ca/articles/29036389310738-Meet-the-Toniebox-2-Features-FAQ)\nciteturn775search9 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: last week; Head to the tonies® app to set your desired time, the sleep light will then turn on and the Tonie placed on top of the Toniebox 2 will play until the timer runs out, before going to sleep too. ... Add the Tonieplay controller in the middle of the light ring and press the button to start.\n\nSimply head to the tonies® app each night before bedtime and set your desired wakeup time for your little listener.\n\nDYNAMIC LIGHT RING\n\nThe Light Ring glows in rainbow colours when Tonies are playing, and gives helpful light cues to guide kids through the Tonieplay games.\n\nImage: 5.gif\n\nTONIEPLAY\n\nTonieplay unlocks new world of interactive games, stories, quizzes, challenges and more, exclusive to Toniebox 2. \n\nReady to play? Here’s how:\n1. Pick a Tonieplay game.\n2. Put it on top of the Toniebox - first play? The Tonieplay game will need to be downloaded before it can be play. This will typically take up to 30 minutes (depending on your internet speed). Note that our longer games, like Quizzles, will take the longest time to download.\n3. Add the Tonieplay controller in the middle of the light ring and press the button to start.\n4. Get ready to play! \n\nImage: 6.gif\n\nWORKS WITH ALL TONIES\n\nYou heard right! Every Tonie that has been released prior to launch of Toniebox 2 will work with the Toniebox 2, and all future Tonies will work with the Toniebox 1. \n\nPlease note: Tonieplay Games will not work with Toniebox 1.\n\nImage: 7.pngImage: 8.pngImage: 9.png\n\nCERTIFIED 1+\n\nThe Toniebox 2 is certified 1+ \n\nDesigned and tested to be safe, intuitive, and engaging for kids aged 1 and up.\n\nThe all new 1+ or 3+ mode can be set and changed via the app. To ensure you have control of the content that can be played on your Toniebox 2.\n\n3+ Age Mode: 🎵 Can play while charging.\n\n1+ Age Mode: ⚠️ Cannot play while charging and tilt to rewind or fast-forward is disabled.\n\nImage: 10.png\n\nUSB-C CHARGING \n\nPower up in no time – keep your Toniebox 2 fully charged and ready to play with fast and easy USB-C charging.\n\nYou can use the 1+ 20cm charging cable included with your Toniebox 2, or any other third party compatible USB-C charging cable. \n\nImage: 11.pngImage: 12.png\n\nNEW TONIES® APP CONTROLS\n\nWith the tonies® app, you can check the battery level, manage your Tonies collection and tweak settings right from your phone. \n\nAnd there's more to come – fresh features are being added all the time to allow you to co-pilot your little one's listening experience.\n\nImage: 13.png\n\nPLAYBACK CONTROLS\n\n👀 Live Playback Status: See exactly which Tonie is on the box and view the chapter currently playing, right from your screen.\n\n⏯️ Pause and Play: Halt the action for a quick snack break and jump right back in when you're ready.\n\n⏮️ Restart and Skip: Instantly rewind to a favourite song or skip ahead to the next chapter.\n\nStill have questions? Reach out to our Customer Happiness team and we can support you further: Click here to contact us--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nWie lange speichert die Toniebox 2 den automatisch gespeicherten Spielstand, wenn die Disc abgenommen, eine Pause eingelegt oder ein anderer Inhalt gespielt/gehört wird? – tonies® Support (https://support.tonies.com/hc/de/articles/29036389045778-Wie-lange-speichert-die-Toniebox-2-den-automatisch-gespeicherten-Spielstand-wenn-die-Disc-abgenommen-eine-Pause-eingelegt-oder-ein-anderer-Inhalt-gespielt-geh%C3%B6rt-wird)\nciteturn775search10 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: last week; Grundsätzlich gilt: Wenn du deine Tonieplay Disc für eine Pause, ein anderes Spiel oder zum Abspielen eines Tonies entfernst, wird der Spielfortschritt gestoppt.\n\n# Wie lange speichert die Toniebox 2 den automatisch gespeicherten Spielstand, wenn die Disc abgenommen, eine Pause eingelegt oder ein anderer Inhalt gespielt/gehört wird?\n\nGrundsätzlich gilt: Wenn du deine Tonieplay Disc für eine Pause, ein anderes Spiel oder zum Abspielen eines Tonies entfernst, wird der Spielfortschritt gestoppt. Das bedeutet, dass das Spiel nicht mehr nur pausiert, sondern von vorne beginnt. \nAllerdings verhält sich jedes Spiel ein wenig anders: Wenn ein Quizspiel mitten in einer Runde gestoppt wird, muss es danach neu gestartet werden. Eine interaktive Geschichte kann jedoch an der letzten Position fortgesetzt werden und bei einem Entdeckungsspiel beginnt eine neue Spielrunde.--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nTonieplay – tonies® Support (https://support.tonies.com/hc/en-au/sections/29036400009490-Tonieplay)\nciteturn775search11 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: 2 days ago; Simply lift the Tonieplay Disc off your Toniebox 2, count to five (a little dramatic pause never hurt anyone ✨), and pop it back on.\n\n# Tonieplay\n\n## Articles\n\n14 articles\n\n### What is Tonieplay?\n\nLet the listening journey continue! Designed especially for Toniebox 2, Tonieplay turns the Toniebox into a safe and screen-free gaming experience. You’ll need a Tonieplay controller to play any of our amazing Tonieplay games – both are sold separately.\n\n### Tonieplay - Troubleshooting Tips\n\nLet's take a look at some of the most common Tonieplay troubleshooting tips, to get your adventure off to a great start! Tonieplay game taking too long to download When you place a Tonieplay game on your Toniebox 2 for the very first time, it needs to download the game before the fun can begin. This...\n\n### Tonieplay game card not recognised\n\nWe’re sorry to hear you’re having trouble with your Tonieplay game cards! Don’t worry - we’ll help you get back on track. Sometimes a simple restart solves the issue: Make sure your Toniebox 2 is on and unplugged. Squeeze both ears until the Toniebox enters the sleep light with timer setting. Keep s...\n\n### How long does the Toniebox 2 remember your auto-saved status when you remove the disc, take a break or play something else?\n\nIf you remove your Tonieplay disc for a break or to play another Tonie product, the progress will stop. This means that the game is not \"paused\" anymore, but you will load it up from scratch again. However, each game acts a little differently. For example the quiz games will not continue a running r...\n\n### Can you ever choose the chapter?\n\nThat highly depends on the games, but in most cases: no. The only game that lets you choose which story to play is Winnie The Pooh.\n\n### Can I restart a Tonieplay game?\n\nNeed to go back a bit in your game? Easy! Simply lift the Tonieplay Disc off your Toniebox 2, count to five (a little dramatic pause never hurt anyone ✨), and pop it back on. Your game will restart from the top, or depending on the Tonieplay game, will pick up at your most recent checkpoint, if you'...\n\n### What do I need in order to play a Tonieplay game?\n\nTo play a Tonieplay Game you’ll need a Toniebox 2 and a Tonieplay Controller. If it’s the first time the game is being played you’ll also need a WiFi connection, but after this it will work offline too.\n\n### How do Tonieplay games appear in the app?\n\nJust like with all our other Tonies, once you’ve put a Tonieplay Game on the Toniebox 2 you’ll be able to see it in the ‘Mine’ section of the app.\n\n### What new Tonieplay specific data will we capture?\n\nWhen you use the new function Tonieplay, usage and operation information about the in-game interaction with the Toniebox will be collected. We process the data (e.g. frequency of use of individual games, errors that resulted in termination of use) for the same purpose as we process all other Interac...--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nTonieplay – tonies® Support (https://support.tonies.com/hc/en-gb/sections/29036400009490-Tonieplay)\nciteturn775view0 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: 2 weeks ago; Content type: text/html; Source: open({\"ref_id\":\"https://support.tonies.com/hc/en-gb/sections/29036400009490-Tonieplay\",\"lineno\":null}); Total lines: 83\nL0: 【0†Skip to main content】\nL1: \nL2: 【1†Contact us】\nL3: \nL4: [Input] English (United Kingdom)\nL5: \nL6: # Tonieplay\nL7: \nL8: ### Popular Articles\nL9: \nL10: Tonieplay\nL11: \nL12: Browse Topic\nL13: \nL14: Quick Search\nL15: \nL16: [Input: Search for articles, guides, and help...]\nL17: \nL18: Read Full Article\nL19: \nL20: ## Articles\nL21: \nL22: 14 articles\nL23: \nL24: ### What is Tonieplay?\nL25: \nL26: 【2†Read Full Article →】\nL27: \nL28: ### Tonieplay - Troubleshooting Tips\nL29: \nL30: 【3†Read Full Article →】\nL31: \nL32: ### Tonieplay game card not recognised\nL33: \nL34: 【4†Read Full Article →】\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nAccount – tonies® Support (https://support.tonies.com/hc/en-gb/sections/29036387798930-Account)\nciteturn775view1 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: last week; Content type: text/html; Source: open({\"ref_id\":\"https://support.tonies.com/hc/en-gb/sections/29036387798930-Account\",\"lineno\":null}); Total lines: 66\nL0: 【0†Skip to main content】\nL1: \nL2: 【1†Contact us】\nL3: \nL4: [Input] English (United Kingdom)\nL5: \nL6: # Account\nL7: \nL8: ### Popular Articles\nL9: \nL10: Account\nL11: \nL12: Browse Topic\nL13: \nL14: Quick Search\nL15: \nL16: [Input: Search for articles, guides, and help...]\nL17: \nL18: #